#: box/info.py
msgid "<ol><li>Put the TV in developer mode: Apps &rarr; press 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 &rarr; Developer mode <b>On</b> and Host PC IP = the IP of your computer or phone. Restart the TV.</li><li>Download the package: <a href='/%(m)s/E2TVPlayer.wgt'><b>E2TVPlayer.wgt</b></a></li><li>Install it with the <a href='https://github.com/Jellyfin2Samsung/Samsung-Jellyfin-Installer'>Samsung Jellyfin Installer</a> (choose a custom .wgt). It takes care of the Samsung certificate.</li></ol><p>Updates come with the box plugin: just restart the app.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: box/info.py
msgid "<p>The TV fetches the app from <a href='/widgetlist.xml'>http://%(h)s/widgetlist.xml</a>.</p><ol><li>TV: Menu &rarr; Smart Hub &rarr; Samsung Account &rarr; Log in. User <b>develop</b> (password empty or 000000).</li><li>Smart Hub &rarr; hold OK on any app &rarr; <b>IP Setting</b> &rarr; <b>%(h)s</b></li><li>Hold OK again &rarr; <b>Start User App Sync</b>.</li><li>The app <b>%(t)s</b> appears in My Apps.</li></ol><p>Update: repeat step 3 and then restart the TV. <a href='/%(m)s/%(z)s'>Download zip</a></p>"
msgstr ""

